arbeitnow:product-engineer-ii-arcgis-arc:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your enthusiasm and knowledge of GIS customization to help build and test advancements to ArcGIS Arcade. Arcade is used by organisations around the world to customize their workflows, QA/QC data input, and create cutting edge visualisations. This is a fantastic opportunity to become part of the product development team and support the delivery of regular, high-quality releases in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us improve our Arcade functional capabilities, test routines, and documentation as part of the ArcGIS Pro development team developing Arcade. You’ll also collaborate with engineers on other products to ensure seamless integration across ArcGIS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri has a Relocation Assistance Program and can provide support with relocating to the Cardiff, UK area for this position. Check out more details of the &lt;a href="https://www.esri.com/en-us/about/about-esri/cardiff-rd"&gt;Esri R&amp;amp;D Center – Cardiff!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply curious, independent thought, and attention to detail to explore and understand the challenges that ArcGIS users face and provide usable, informative feedback on user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rich and varied GIS datasets and maps, sample applications and articles that can be used to highlight product capabilities, explain scripting functions, and guide scripting best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your development team, and teams across Esri, to design, create, and validate the newest datasets and GIS workflows to support visualisation, map labelling, pop-ups, attribute rules and verify the functionality meets user workflows and is consistent with Esri ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Describe GIS best practices and demonstrate how to apply these GIS workflows in internal team meetings, on product forums and websites, with customers, at Esri events, or in publications like the ArcGIS Blog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about and collaborate in AI code generation experiences to explore issues, investigate problems, and design and prototype enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build focused test code to represent complex situations for investigation and regression testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer, automate, and manage online and database GIS systems and services to support the development of new product features and ongoing product releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of GIS experience (such as modeling, analyzing, or presenting geospatial data in a scientific, engineering, governmental, or post graduate academic environment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with mapping, spatial data or GIS platforms such as ArcGIS or QGIS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytic skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven initiative and creativity to find ways to explore, investigate, test and validate software behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of, and interest in, scripting or coding to appreciate our end users' challenges and to communicate effectively with the development team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and team collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in GIS, geography, computer science, engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing work authorisation for the United Kingdom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recommended Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and passion for working with cartography, mapping or geospatial data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in or knowledge of AI code generation and development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of user communication and education such as having been responsible for product documentation, blogs, written or video tutorials, presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity using version control systems such as Git, for documentation and code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with some of the scripting or coding languages such as Python, Lua, JavaScript, Perl, or Typescript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in GIS, computer science, engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary is one component of our total rewards strategy. Compensation decisions and the base range for this role take into account many factors including but not limited to skill sets; experience and training; licensure and certifications; and other business and organizational needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A reasonable estimate of the base salary range is £37,080 - £58,092.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EL1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Esri, diversity is more than just a word on a map. When employees of different experiences, perspectives, backgrounds, and cultures come together, we are more innovative and ultimately a better place to work. We believe in having a diverse workforce that is unified under our mission of creating positive global change. We understand that diversity, equity, and inclusion is not a destination but an ongoing process. We are committed to the continuation of learning, growing, and changing our workplace so every employee can contribute to their life’s best work. Our commitment to these principles extends to the global communities we serve by creating positive change with GIS technology. For more information on Esri’s Racial Equity and Social Justice initiatives, please visit our website &lt;a href="https://www.esri.com/en-us/racial-equity/overview#engage-communities" target="_blank"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you don’t meet all of the preferred qualifications for this position, we encourage you to still apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esri is an equal opportunity employer (EOE) and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. If you need reasonable accommodation for any part of the employment process, please email &lt;a ---------- and let us know the nature of your request and your contact information. Please note that only those inquiries concerning a request for reasonable accommodation will be responded to from this e-mail address.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.esri.com/en-us/privacy/overview"&gt;Esri Privacy&lt;/a&gt; Esri takes our responsibility to protect your privacy seriously. We are committed to respecting your privacy by providing transparency in how we acquire and use your information, giving you control of your information and preferences, and holding ourselves to the highest national and international standards, including CCPA and GDPR compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:software-engineer-platform-par:
&lt;p&gt;The mission of Speechify is to make sure that reading is never a barrier to learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 50 million people use Speechify’s text-to-speech products to turn whatever they’re reading – PDFs, books, Google Docs, news articles, websites – into audio, so they can read faster, read more, and remember more. Speechify’s text-to-speech reading products include its iOS app, Android App, Mac App, Chrome Extension, and Web App.&amp;nbsp;Google recently named Speechify the Chrome Extension of the Year and Apple named Speechify its 2025 Design Award winner for Inclusivity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, nearly 200 people around the globe work on Speechify in a 100% distributed setting – Speechify has no office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left;" data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;The Platform team owns the backend behind everything Speechify ships: the public TTS API,&amp;nbsp;payments, subscriptions, auth, consumption tracking, and analytics — serving over 50&amp;nbsp;million users across iOS, Android, Mac, Chrome, and web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left;" data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;These are systems where correctness compounds. Subscription state has to stay consistent&amp;nbsp;across five clients and two app-store billing systems that each go quiet at the worst moment.&amp;nbsp;Consumption metering has to be exact enough to bill on and cheap enough to run at our&amp;nbsp;request volume. The public TTS API has external customers with their own products&amp;nbsp;depending on our latency and uptime. None of this degrades gracefully — it is either right, or&amp;nbsp;someone gets charged twice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;The job is to make your own job smaller. Every system you own here should need less of&amp;nbsp;you a year from now than it did the day you took it, and the reward for that is a larger one.&amp;nbsp;That is the entire growth path on this team — there is no separate ladder, and no ceiling&amp;nbsp;except the one you stop raising. We are a flat organization: people become leaders here by&amp;nbsp;taking scope and being right about it, fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Yo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;u’&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Design, build, and own the APIs behind payments, subscriptions, auth, consumption&amp;nbsp;tracking, and our public TTS API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Take on services you didn't write and make them faster, cheaper, and harder to break&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Establish that a change is correct before it ships, and leave behind the checks that keep it&amp;nbsp;correct after you've moved on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Automate the parts of your role that shouldn't need a person, then go take on what that&amp;nbsp;freed you up for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Turn work you've done once into work the whole team can repeat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Design B2B and enterprise integrations for customers building on top of us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;Work with product, mobile, and web to keep backend architecture ahead of where the&amp;nbsp;product is going&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An Ideal Candidate Should Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven backend experience in TS/Node (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with GCP; working knowledge of AWS, Azure, or another cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A habit of giving away work you used to own, and something to show for the room it&amp;nbsp;created&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily working setup with AI agents you can describe in detail — what runs unattended,&amp;nbsp;what you review, and where you've decided it doesn't get to act alone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The instinct to check a result against the system itself — logs, database state, the actual&amp;nbsp;request — rather than against a summary of it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Judgment about what not to build, and the ability to say plainly why you dropped it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A preference for being corrected over being right&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: Docker and containerized deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: deploying high-availability applications on Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Several technical interviews plus a take-home assessment on a real codebase. We aim to&amp;nbsp;finish within a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The assessment runs in two stages: you'll submit, get real feedback from an engineer on this&amp;nbsp;team, and have time to act on it. Use the tools you use every day. You'll be asked to walk&amp;nbsp;through your reasoning, so bring it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-speechify-sentence=""&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic environment where your contributions shape the company and its products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that values innovation, intuition, and drive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy, fostering focus and creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to have a significant impact in a revolutionary industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, a welcoming atmosphere, and a commitment to an exceptional asynchronous work culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The privilege of working on a product that changes lives, particularly for those with learning differences like dyslexia, ADD, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An active role at the intersection of artificial intelligence and audio – a rapidly evolving tech domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The France Based &lt;/strong&gt;Salary range for this role is: 30,000-100,000 USD/Year + Bonus + Stock depending on experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think you’re a good fit for this job?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tell us more about yourself and why you're interested in the role when you apply. &lt;br&gt;And don’t forget to include links to your portfolio and LinkedIn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not looking but know someone who would make a great fit?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer them!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speechify is committed to a diverse and inclusive workplace.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Speechify does not discriminate on the basis of race, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, or other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:fullstack-engineer-mid-level-a:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type="bold"&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;We're looking for a Fullstack Engineer to join our Actions team in building the core infrastructure that powers our plugin platform. You'll create the UI components, integration layers, and security mechanisms that enable our customers to extend the platform with custom integrations while maintaining safety and flexibility across our 1,500+ customer base. This is essential infrastructure work that shapes how our customers scale their integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;The Actions team sits at the heart of Staffbase's AI ambitions. We're the team that gives Navigator — our AI assistant and the main entry point into Staffbase — the ability to actually do things: submit a form, complete a task inside an integration, or take an action on a user's behalf through the agent. If Navigator is the brain, we build the hands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;That means two big things. First, we enrich what the AI can see and act on, our plugins, our widgets and the wider Staffbase platform so the assistant can do real work, not just talk about it. Second, we build the extensions that connect to the tools people already use, like Workday, Personio, ServiceNow and Microsoft.   We're not just shipping features, though. A core part of our mission is building the extensibility framework that lets others build too.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Building a UI component library that generated apps can assemble from, turning components like payslip views and approval flows into maintained, reusable pieces instead of regenerated artifacts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Creating the connection layer between generated apps and customer source systems—HR platforms, time-tracking and scheduling systems, and a long tail of vendors with thin or undocumented APIs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Defining extension points (widgets, menus, sidebars) so plugins declare where they surface and what they connect to in a single, clean configuration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Designing and implementing a cross-integration authentication solution that lets customers run multiple integrations without forcing employees to log in repeatedly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Shipping plugins on the platform yourself, staying a consumer of what we build so we catch gaps early&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Strong knowledge of React and TypeScript for frontend work Java/Kotlin or Go an TypeScript experience for backend services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Real experience integrating third-party APIs, especially the challenging ones—inconsistent auth, partial documentation, legacy and on-prem systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Deep understanding of multi-tenancy security and data isolation; you care about scope checks and preventing cross-tenant leaks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Good judgment about what to standardize and what to leave flexible—drawing that line in the right place is central to this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have experience &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;You are comfortable with edge and serverless runtimes like Cloudflare Workers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;You have built a plugin system, SDK, or developer platform before&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Developed a design system or component library that other teams depended on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Real-world experience with OAuth and enterprise SSO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Experience treating AI code generation as a product surface, not just a personal tool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you'll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/em&gt; - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility &lt;/em&gt;- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Recharge&lt;/em&gt; - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;-&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we offer offering a company pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Volunteers Day&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img src="https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5" alt="" style="max-width: 100%;"&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:platform-engineer-london-43649:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About Akuna:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Akuna Capital&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;is an innovative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;&amp;nbsp;trading firm with a strong focus on collaboration,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;&amp;nbsp;technology, data driven solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; and automation. We specialize in providing liquidity as an options market maker – meaning we are committed to providing competitive quotes that we are willing to both buy and sell. To do this successfully&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;&amp;nbsp;we design and implement our own low latency technologies, trading strategies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;&amp;nbsp;and mathematical models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:350}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Our Founding Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;first conceptualized Akuna in their hometown of Sydney. They opened the firm’s first office in 2011 in the heart of the derivatives industry and the options capital of the world – Chicago. Today, Akuna is proud to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;additional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;&amp;nbsp;offices in Sydney, Shanghai,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;London,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; Singapore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:350}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;do as a&amp;nbsp;Platform Engineer&amp;nbsp;at Akuna:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[9360],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[4]}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;This is an exciting role where you will be given the opportunity to take ownership of projects and make them your own. At Akuna, we are constantly looking for ways to improve our efficiency as we continue to grow. As a Platform Engineer, you will work closely with our Trading, Development, Infrastructure, and Operations teams. You will design and implement cloud solutions, automate infrastructure as code, improve cloud governance and security, and&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;our hybrid-cloud environments. I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;n this role, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:330}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;Ensure cloud services are leveraged to their full potential (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud) and best practices are being followed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Help manage our public cloud growth and continuously improve Akuna’s hybrid-cloud operating model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props="{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"&gt;Evaluate proposed solution architectures and provide recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
